{"id": "122839", "name": "סדרה רקורסיבית a_(n+1)=(a_n+c/a_n)/2 – שלושה איברים ראשונים ואי-שוויון (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 10, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "nextElement", "params": ["x"], "body": "(x+(c/x))/2"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><p>Consider the sequence</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ a_1 = 1, a_{n+1} = \\frac{1}{2}(a_n + \\frac{{{CT:0}}}{a_n}) \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-right:8px\">a</span></div><p>please enter the first three elements of the sequence</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\( a_1 = \\) [[input:studa1]]&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\\( a_2 = \\) [[input:studa2]]&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\\( a_3 = \\) [[input:studa3]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:studa1]] [[validation:studa2]] [[validation:studa3]]</div></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-right:8px\">b</span></div><p>For which values of x does the following inequality hold</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:1}} &gt; x \\]</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ineq]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ineq]]</div><p style=\"font-size:0.92em;margin:8px 0 0\">Write inequalities with <code dir=\"ltr\">and</code> and <code dir=\"ltr\">or</code>, for example <code dir=\"ltr\">x&lt;-2 or (x&gt;1 and x&lt;5)</code>.</p></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Outline:</b> In part 1 apply the recurrence twice. In part 2 reduce the inequality to a simple one and solve it separately for \\(x>0\\) and for \\(x&lt;0\\), since multiplying by a negative \\(x\\) reverses the inequality.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 1 — The first three terms</b><br>The first term is given, \\(a_1=1\\). Each further term is obtained from the previous one by the recurrence:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ a_2=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(1+\\frac{{{CT:0}}}{1}\\right)={{CT:2}} \\]</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ a_3=\\frac{1}{2}\\left({{CT:2}}+\\frac{{{CT:0}}}{{{CT:2}}}\\right)={{CT:3}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 2 — Reducing the inequality</b><br>The expression is defined only for \\(x\\neq 0\\). Multiply both sides by 2 (a positive number) and subtract \\(x\\):<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\frac{1}{2}\\left(x+\\frac{{{CT:0}}}{x}\\right) &gt; x \\iff x+\\frac{{{CT:0}}}{x} &gt; 2x \\iff \\frac{{{CT:0}}}{x} &gt; x \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 3 — Solving by the sign of \\(x\\)</b><br>If \\(x>0\\), multiplying by \\(x\\) keeps the direction: \\({{CT:0}} &gt; x^2\\), that is \\(0 &lt; x &lt; {{CT:4}}\\).<br>If \\(x&lt;0\\), multiplying by \\(x\\) reverses the direction: \\({{CT:0}} &lt; x^2\\), and since \\(x\\) is negative, \\(x &lt; -{{CT:4}}\\).<br>The solution set is the union of the two cases:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ x &lt; -{{CT:4}}\\quad\\text{or}\\quad 0 &lt; x &lt; {{CT:4}} \\]</p>In the input syntax: <code dir=\"ltr\">x&lt;-sqrt({{CT:5}}) or (x&gt;0 and x&lt;sqrt({{CT:5}}))</code>.</div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>שאלה 1</b> - [[feedback:prt1]]</div><div dir=\"rtl\"><b>שאלה 2</b> - [[feedback:prt2]]</div>", "prtcorrect": "<p>Correct answer, well done.</p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p>Your answer is partially correct.</p>", "prtincorrect": "<p>Incorrect answer.</p>", "inputs": [{"name": "studa1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 5, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 0, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "studa2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 5, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 0, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "studa3", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 5, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 0, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ineq", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 30, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "studa1", "tans": "a1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0.3333333, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">ערכו של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(a_1\\)</span> נכון</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">ערכו של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(a_1\\)</span> שגוי</div>"}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "studa2", "tans": "a2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0.3333333, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "prt1-2-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">ערכו של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(a_2\\)</span> נכון</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "prt1-2-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">ערכו של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(a_2\\)</span> שגוי</div>"}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "studa3", "tans": "a3", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0.3333333, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-3-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">ערכו של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(a_3\\)</span> נכון</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-3-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">ערכו של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(a_3\\)</span> שגוי</div>"}}]}, {"name": "prt2", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ineq", "tans": "ta4", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["a1", "a2", "a3", "c", "d", "recS", "ta4"], "nvariants": 4}